;; Book chapters in reading order (paths relative to notebooks/); the first one becomes the index page.
;; Reference: concepts first (charts, builders and data functions follow); use case sections follow the R Graph
;; Gallery site order; galleries: cljplot extras, lattice, vega.
;; Parts without chapters are left out of the book.
